pve-tools (1.9.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * pve-sdn-healthcheck 1.0.1: fix mtu_local false positive when the
    VXLAN carrier is a jumbo parent bridge (for example vmbr0) but route
    lookup to a VTEP selects a 1500-byte host service VLAN subinterface
    (for example vmbr0.$VLANTAG).

